    <ul>
        <li>Keep your password to yourself. You're responsible for what happens on your account.</li>
        <li>Pick a hero name and portrait that are fine for everyone to see. No hate, harassment, sexual content, impersonation or anyone else's personal information.</li>
        <li>You can download your data or delete your hero at any time from <b>Your account and data</b> in town.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Fair play</h2>
    <ul>
        <li>No cheating, automation, exploiting bugs, or playing duels against your own second account to farm gold or rating.</li>
