        covers the code, not your account or this hosted service.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
    <p>
        These terms may change; the date above shows the latest version, and playing after a change means you accept it.
        Questions? Get in touch through <a href="@LegalInfo.ContactUrl">@LegalInfo.Contact</a>. How your data is handled
        is in the <a href="privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>
</InfoPage>
